/AnnualReport/533573/77265533573.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2021","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/68572533573.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2020","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730320.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2019","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730319.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2018","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730318.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2017","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730317.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"","title":"Annual Report 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/533573/5335730312.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"Alembic Pharmaceuticals reported a strong performance in Q2 and H1 FY27, with consolidated revenue growing 36% year-on-year to INR2,603 crores, driven by growth across all business segments. The company raised its FY27 consolidated revenue growth guidance to 20% to 25%, backed by an improved U.S. outlook and strong API growth. Management highlighted expanding gross margins, ongoing commercial execution in the India branded business, and strategic collaborations such as the expanded partnership with DifGen Pharmaceuticals. Furthermore, net debt remained comfortable at under 1x of full-year EBITDA, while the U.S.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company expects the U.S. business to grow up to 40% year-on-year for the full year.","quote":"We now expect the U.S. business to grow up to 40% Y-on-Y for the full year, supported by base business volumes, new launches and continued scale-up of our specialty portfolio.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The API business is expected to deliver at least high teens growth for the year.","quote":"API business has also performed ahead of our expectations and is now expected to deliver at least high teens growth for the year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects the ex-U.S. business to grow at mid-teens.","quote":"We expect the ex-U.S. to grow at mid-teens.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Management raised the FY27 consolidated revenue growth guidance to about 20% to 25%.","quote":"Reflecting the stronger outlook for the U.S. and API, we are raising our FY27 consolidated revenue growth guidance to about 20% to 25% from the mid-teens indicated last quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The company expects the overall growth outlook for FY27 to improve from the low double-digit range to closer to the mid-teen range.","quote":"As a result, we believe the overall growth outlook for the company can improve from the low double-digit range that we had discussed earlier to closer to the mid-teen range for FY27.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"},{"claim":"Management now expects the U.S. business to grow mid to high teens in the year.","quote":"At the beginning of the year, we had indicated that the US Generics could grow in the low to mid-teens based on the performance and the trends we're seeing in Q1, the launch outlook and current volume trends, we now expect the US business to grow mid to high teens in the year, subject to normal market conditions and continued execution.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"The specialty portfolio grew about 200 basis points ahead of the Indian pharmaceutical market during the quarter.","quote":"The specialty portfolio grew about 200 basis points ahead of the Indian pharmaceutical market during the quarter, and the overall growth gap versus the market has narrowed meaningfully.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The acute portfolio is expected to improve progressively over the coming quarters.","quote":"We expect the acute portfolio to improve progressively over the coming quarters as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Pricing pressure remains in the U.S. environment, but growth during the quarter was predominantly volume driven.","quote":"Pricing pressure remains in the environment, but growth during the quarter was predominantly volume driven.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The company spent about INR250 crores of capex for the first half of the financial year.","quote":"Moving on to capital expenditure for the first half. We spent about INR250 crores of capex.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Management noted continued investments in manufacturing capabilities, debottlenecking initiatives, and capacity enhancement programs.","quote":"We also continued investments in manufacturing capabilities, debottlenecking initiatives and capacity enhancement programs that will support future growth and improve operating leverage.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Gross margin expanded by 70 basis points year-on-year to 73.7% for the quarter.","quote":"Gross margin expanded by 70 basis points year-on-year to 73.7%, benefiting from favorable product mix despite higher solvent costs and geopolitical headwinds.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"The company continues to operate within its guided range of 70% to 75% gross margins.","quote":"We continue to operate within our guided range of 70% to 75% gross margins.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Reported EBITDA grew 78%, while the EBITDA margin expanded by around 520 basis points to 22.2% in the current quarter.","quote":"Reported EBITDA grew 78%, while the EBITDA margin expanded by around 520 basis points from 17% in quarter 2 of last year to 22.2% in the current quarter.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Reported EBITDA grew at 21% year-on-year to INR348 crores with an EBITDA margin of 16%.","quote":"Reported EBITDA grew at 21% year-on-year to INR348 crores with EBITDA margin at 16%.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"},{"claim":"R&D expenditure during the quarter was INR186 crores, representing about 9% of revenue.","quote":"As planned, we continue to invest behind future growth opportunities and our R&D expenditure during the quarter was at INR186 crores, representing about 9% of revenue, driven by peptide development activities, exhibit batches and higher regulatory filings and portfolio development initiatives.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"Net debt remains comfortable at INR1,236 crores, which is less than 1x of full year EBITDA.","quote":"Net debt remains comfortable at INR1,236 crores, which is less than 1x of full year EBITDA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf"},{"claim":"Gross debt stood at around INR1,600 crores, with the increase compared to March driven by higher receivables from higher sales.","quote":"So gross debt was about -- we are at around INR1,600 crores of gross debt and 2 things have happened. So, one is we have the debt levels have a bit higher than the March numbers, it is purely towards additional receivables that has increased because of higher sales.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"The external environment continues to remain competitive with pricing pressure, regulatory expectations, and geopolitical uncertainties.","quote":"The external environment continues to remain competitive with pricing pressure, regulatory expectations and geopolitical uncertainties.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"},{"claim":"Due to Middle East issues, solvent prices went up, impacting gross margins.","quote":"One is, of course, with a bit of the Middle East issues going on, we had seen solvent prices going up. That has had a bit of impact.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The near-term objective for the India business is to reach market level growth in the next 2 to 3 quarters.","quote":"In India, our near term objective is to reach market level growth in the next 2 to 3 quarters.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"The existing pipeline supports a steady cadence of more than 30 launches over the next 18 months.","quote":"Our existing pipeline supports a steady cadence of more than 30 launches over the next 18 months with around a quarter of them comprising of FTF or shared day-1 opportunities.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf","timeframe":"next 2 years"},{"claim":"Contributions from the DifGen partnership are expected to begin from FY28.","quote":"Contributions are expected to begin from FY28 with the initial wave of launches providing near-term revenue visibility and a platform for progressively increasing contribution to the U.S. business as the portfolio is commercialized over the next few years.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf","timeframe":"FY27"},{"claim":"Management expects to start breaking even in the U.S. branded business in the first half of next year.","quote":"I believe that we will start breaking even in the first half of next -- by the end of this year or the first half of next year is when we'll break even.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-11-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=5991f5bd-f70d-4eb3-bd32-07b794edf376.pdf","timeframe":"H2 FY26"},{"claim":"Management expects the U.S. Branded Specialty business to start contributing positively to profit next financial year onwards.","quote":"As the U.S. Branded Specialty business scales up over the next few quarters, we will see a positive contribution to profit, which should consequently drive a broader enhancement in consolidated margins.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf","timeframe":"next financial year onwards"},{"claim":"The company plans to launch another 15-odd products for the rest of the year in the U.S.","quote":"Yes. I think for the rest of the year, we should be launching another 15-odd products.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf","timeframe":"rest of the year"},{"claim":"Management's goal is to reduce debt levels to reasonably close to 1x of EBITDA.","quote":"And our intention is to scale it down further so that we are able to maintain it at a reasonably close to 1x of EBITDA.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-08-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=b8f27d1b-f644-4885-a463-793dbbfce7ca.pdf","timeframe":""}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":27,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":0,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}